GuaranIA — Translation Validator

Origins
-------
This project is derived from the tool used by the Universidad Nacional
de Itapúa (UNI) for its Lacuna Fund translation hackathon.

Original repository:
https://github.com/aalvarez-fiuni/guarani-corpus-lacuna-uni

Original instance of the tool:
https://guarani.uni.edu.py/login

Authorship of the original code is acknowledged to its respective authors.
References to UNI and Lacuna Fund describe the project's origins.

GuaranIA modifications
---------------------
Copyright 2026 the GuaranIA contributors, with respect to their own
contributions.

GuaranIA maintains a modified version of the original repository. Changes
made to prepare it for reuse include environment-based configuration,
administrator creation adjustments, disabling hackathon promotion, and
separating datasets, generated reports, and unused legacy modules from
the distributed code.

